<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MI CAMINO</view><view class="title">每一步，都算数。</view><view class="subtitle">真正的进步，是今天比昨天多懂一点。</view>
<view class="stats body"><view class="stat"><view class="number">{{streak}}</view><view class="label">连续打卡</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="number">{{checkins}}</view><view class="label">累计打卡</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="number">{{grammarPassed}}</view><view class="label">语法达标</view></view></view>
<view class="section-title">最近 14 天</view><view class="card"><view class="calendar"><view wx:for="{{calendar}}" wx:key="key" class="day {{item.done ? 'done' : ''}} {{item.today ? 'today' : ''}}">{{item.label}}</view></view><view class="small body">深绿色代表当日完成词汇目标 + 达标语法练习。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">词汇积累</view><view>{{learned}} / {{wordTotal}}</view></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{learned / wordTotal * 100}}%"></view></view><view class="small">已学习表示有复习记录，不等于已长期掌握。</view></view>
<view class="section-title">每天，给自己一点时间</view><view class="card"><view class="goal-options"><button wx:for="{{[3,5,10]}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{goal === item ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-goal="{{item}}" bindtap="goal">{{item}} 个词</button></view><view class="small body">当前设置 {{goal}} 个词 / 天 + 1 次达标语法。当天首次学习时固定目标，之后调整对下一天生效。</view></view>
<view class="section-title">错题回顾 · {{mistakes.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{!mistakes.length}}" class="card empty">暂无待订正错题。练习中的错题会出现在这里。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">词汇错词本</view><view class="pill">{{wrongWords.length}} 个待订正</view></view><view wx:for="{{wrongWords}}" wx:key="id" class="body"><view>{{item.spanish}} · {{item.meaning}}</view><view class="small">你的答案：{{item.answer}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!wrongWords.length}}" class="small body">词汇测验中答错的词会保存在这里。</view><button wx:if="{{wrongWords.length}}" class="secondary" bindtap="wordRetry">集中重练错词 →</button></view>
<view wx:for="{{mistakes}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="list-title">{{item.prompt}}</view><view class="body muted">你的答案：{{item.options[item.selected]}}</view><view class="body">正确答案：{{item.options[item.answer]}}</view><view class="small body">{{item.explanation}}</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.lessonId}}" bindtap="retry">重练本课，订正错题 →</button></view>
<view class="section-title">学习记录</view><view class="card"><view class="muted">记录保存在当前设备，尚无账号和云同步。清理微信缓存或更换设备可能丢失记录。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportData">复制备份记录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="importData">从剪贴板导入备份</button></view>
</view>
